{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15015","headline":"宝泉寺送李益端公归邠宁幕 · 卢纶","name":"宝泉寺送李益端公归邠宁幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"参差岩障东，云日晃龙宫。\n石净非因雨，松凉不爲风。\n恋泉将鹤并，偷果与猨同。\n眼界尘虽染，心源蔽已通。\n莲花国何限，贝叶字无穷。\n早晚登麟阁，慈门欲付公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}